-- Formulary: nutrition-panel values for 40 products from manufacturers'
-- published datasheets (Abbott, Nutricia, Nestlé, Wyeth), found October 2026.
--
-- These are NOT taken from the packs SQH stocks. Most sources are UK, EU,
-- US or Australian versions; Middle East formulations can differ. Every
-- product stays unverified: a dietitian must check each value against the
-- pack in hand and press Verify before it can drive the calculators.
-- source_url links to the page the values came from.
-- Not found (still need the label): S-26 PDF Gold, S-26 Gold 1, S-26 Gold 2,
-- S-26 Ultima 1, Novalac AD, Aptamil Advance 2 CESAR.

